01:02:04,320 --> 01:02:09,820
This one here had just this one was one wavelength to here this one was two.

648
01:02:09,820 --> 01:02:10,960
This one was three.

649
01:02:10,960 --> 01:02:19,420
So in this particular direction, all of these waves are in phase and they contribute to positive interference.

650
01:02:19,420 --> 01:02:23,360
And that is called the Bragg condition.

651
01:02:23,360 --> 01:02:31,760
Each of these diffraction patterns I can now project here in the pupil plane for the lens as a particular spot.

